{"id":"n1-041","title":"Noun といわず Noun といわず (A to iwazu B to iwazu)","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Expresses 'both A and B' or 'be it A or B'; applies to both without distinction.","longExplanation":"The grammar pattern AといわずBといわず means 'be it A or B' or 'both A and B.' It emphasizes that something applies widely, without distinguishing between A and B.","formation":"Noun1 + といわず + Noun2 + といわず + (rest of the sentence)","examples":[{"jp":"冬といわず夏といわず、彼はいつもアイスクリームを食べます。","romaji":"Fuyu to iwazu natsu to iwazu, kare wa itsumo aisukuriimu o tabemasu.","en":"Be it winter or summer, he always eats ice cream.","words":[{"surface":"冬","vocabId":"1446070","reading":"ふゆ"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いわ","vocabId":"1217270","reading":"いわ","baseForm":"いう"},{"surface":"ず","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ぬ"},{"surface":"夏","vocabId":"1191320","reading":"なつ"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いわ","vocabId":"1217270","reading":"いわ","baseForm":"いう"},{"surface":"ず","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ぬ"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いつも","vocabId":"1188890","reading":"いつも"},{"surface":"アイスクリーム","vocabId":null},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"食べ","vocabId":"1358280","reading":"たべる","baseForm":"食べる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,2,3,5,6,7]},{"jp":"老いといわず若きといわず、全ての人がそのイベントを楽しめます。","romaji":"Oi to iwazu wakaki to iwazu, subete no hito ga sono ibento o tanoshimemasu.","en":"Whether old or young, everyone can enjoy that event.","words":[{"surface":"老い","vocabId":"1643510","reading":"おい"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いわ","vocabId":"1217270","reading":"いわ","baseForm":"いう"},{"surface":"ず","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ぬ"},{"surface":"若き","vocabId":"1324300","reading":"わかい","baseForm":"若い"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いわ","vocabId":"1217270","reading":"いわ","baseForm":"いう"},{"surface":"ず","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ぬ"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"全て","vocabId":"1595730","reading":"すべて"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"人","vocabId":"1580640","reading":"ひと"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"その","vocabId":null},{"surface":"イベント","vocabId":null},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"楽しめ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"楽しめる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,2,3,5,6,7]},{"jp":"男といわず女といわず、誰もがこの映画を楽しむでしょう。","romaji":"Otoko to iwazu onna to iwazu, daremo ga kono eiga o tanoshimu deshou.","en":"Be it men or women, everyone will enjoy this movie.","words":[{"surface":"男","vocabId":"1419990","reading":"おとこ"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いわ","vocabId":"1217270","reading":"いわ","baseForm":"いう"},{"surface":"ず","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ぬ"},{"surface":"女","vocabId":"1344930","reading":"おんな"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いわ","vocabId":"1217270","reading":"いわ","baseForm":"いう"},{"surface":"ず","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ぬ"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"誰","vocabId":"1416830","reading":"だれ"},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"映画","vocabId":"1173720","reading":"えいが"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"楽しむ","vocabId":"1207270","reading":"たのしむ"},{"surface":"でしょ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"です"},{"surface":"う","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,2,3,5,6,7]},{"jp":"月といわず火といわず、あの店は毎日混んでいます。","romaji":"Getsu to iwazu ka to iwazu, ano mise wa mainichi konde imasu.","en":"Be it Monday or Tuesday, that shop is busy every day.","words":[{"surface":"月","vocabId":"1255430","reading":"つき"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いわ","vocabId":"1217270","reading":"いわ","baseForm":"いう"},{"surface":"ず","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ぬ"},{"surface":"火","vocabId":"1193610","reading":"ひ"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いわ","vocabId":"12172